# Agent CLI

Prefer JSON. Human tables live in the
[README](https://github.com/koliyo/okmate/blob/main/README.md#cli) and
[Docs CLI](/docs/cli/).

## Roots and sync

```sh
okmate roots --format json --no-sync
okmate roots --format paths
okmate sync
```

JSON objects are `{ id, kind, path, revision, incoming, enabled, error }`.
Tokens never appear.

## One-root query

```sh
okmate check knowledge --profile strict --format json
okmate inspect --profile strict catalog knowledge
okmate inspect --profile strict concept architecture/system-overview knowledge
okmate inspect --profile strict graph knowledge
okmate search "system overview" knowledge --profile strict
```

Place `--profile` before `catalog`, `concept`, or `graph`.

## Author loop

1. `okmate roots --format paths`
2. `okmate inspect --profile strict catalog <root>`
3. Edit Markdown in that root only.
4. `okmate check <root> --profile strict --format json`

There is no MCP tool and no cross-root `search`.
